## B02: 2020A 炉温曲线 (baseline, Round 1: 96)

### DecisionContract 执行链路
```
Q1: heat_transfer → scipy 有限差分 → ✅ model_family:physics 已覆盖
Q2: parameter_identification → scipy.optimize.least_squares → ✅
Q3: single_objective → scipy.optimize.minimize_scalar → ✅ optimization 标准
Q4: sensitivity → 参数扫描 → ✅ statistics
```

### ModelResult
```json
